T*
(   CSS provides native declarative capabilities to animate styling changes over time:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. CSS Transitions:) Tj
T*
(   Smoothly interpolates property values between two distinct states \(e.g., normal vs :hover\):) Tj
T*
(   `transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier\(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1\), opacity 0.3s ease;`) Tj
T*
(   Properties include: transition-property, transition-duration, transition-timing-function, and) Tj
T*
(   transition-delay.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. CSS Keyframe Animations \(@keyframes\):) Tj
T*
(   Enables complex multi-stage cyclic or one-shot animations without user interaction:) Tj
T*
