(   /* 1. Declare layer precedence order \(lowest to highest\) */) Tj
T*
(   @layer reset, base, framework, components, utilities;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   @layer framework {) Tj
T*
(   /* High specificity ID selector inside lower layer */) Tj
T*
(   #nav.primary .item { color: black; }) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   @layer components {) Tj
T*
(   /* Low specificity class selector inside higher layer */) Tj
T*
(   .item { color: blue; }) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Resolution: Even though `#nav.primary .item` has a specificity of \(0,1,1,1\) in the framework) Tj
T*
(   layer, `.item` in the components layer WINS because declarations in later layers always defeat) Tj
T*
(   declarations in earlier layers regardless of internal specificity!) Tj
T*
() Tj
