(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the implementation of CSS Scroll Snap points for creating carousel and full-page touch sliders.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   CSS Scroll Snap provides native, hardware-accelerated touch swipe snapping without third-party) Tj
T*
(   JavaScript carousel plugins:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   ```css) Tj
T*
(   .carousel-container {) Tj
T*
(   display: flex;) Tj
T*
(   overflow-x: auto;) Tj
T*
(   scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; /* Enforces horizontal snapping */) Tj
T*
(   scroll-behavior: smooth;) Tj
T*
(   gap: 16px;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   .carousel-slide {) Tj
T*
(   flex: 0 0 100%; /* Each slide occupies full viewport width */) Tj
T*
(   scroll-snap-align: center; /* Snaps slide to center */) Tj
T*
(   scroll-snap-stop: always; /* Prevents skipping slides on fast swipe */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
(   This produces ultra-smooth 120 FPS swipe experiences natively supported by mobile gestures.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
