T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The CSS Multi-Column Layout module formats text into flowing newspaper-style vertical columns:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Core Properties:) Tj
T*
(   1. column-count: Specifies the exact number of columns \(e.g., column-count: 3;\).) Tj
T*
(   2. column-width: Sets minimum column width; browser calculates column count responsively) Tj
T*
